        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Organizations: FC Barcelona\n- Events: 2015–16 FC Barcelona season, 2016–17 FC Barcelona season\n- Competitions: La Liga, Copa del Rey, Spanish top flight\n- Concepts: Double, Treble\n\nFacts:\n- The 2015–16 FC Barcelona season was Football Club Barcelona's 116th season in existence and its 85th consecutive season in the top flight of Spanish football.\n- In the 2015–16 FC Barcelona season, Barcelona was involved in six competitions after completing the Treble in the previous season.\n- The 2016–17 FC Barcelona season was Football Club Barcelona's 117th season in existence and its 86th consecutive season in the top flight of Spanish football.\n- In the 2016–17 FC Barcelona season, Barcelona was involved in four competitions after winning the Double of La Liga and Copa del Rey in the previous season.",
